1
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:12,880
Thanks for coming.

2
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,640
Sorry to call you over
right after your flight.

3
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,280
Ms. Liang,

4
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,239
I'm Xu Yishan.

5
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,340
Prosecutor Xu,

6
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:19,360
you must get justice for my mother.

7
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,120
Please calm down.

8
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,180
Let's talk inside.

9
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,000
Did Cheng Jia ever mention anything to you

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,320
about Cui Xiangqin?

11
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:28,290
She did say some bad things
about Cui Xiangqin

12
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:29,880
at home.

13
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,360
But I swear,

14
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:32,680
she's just outspoken.

15
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:33,880
She was just venting.

16
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:36,120
She would never do something like murder.

17
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:38,520
But all the current evidence
points to her.

18
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:39,010
Then,

19
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:39,920
Prosecutor,

20
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:41,920
is there no hope at all

21
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,320
for my wife's case?

22
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:49,080
According to the forensics,

23
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,520
the aspirin Cheng Jia administered

24
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:52,680
was the main cause of the severe bleeding,

25
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:54,920
so she must bear responsibility
for the fatal outcome.

26
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,280
We are willing to pay compensation,

27
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,340
whatever it takes.

28
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:59,280
As long as she can get a reduced sentence.

29
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:00,880
My father passed away early.

30
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,640
I was raised by my mom alone.

31
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:05,800
Now I'm the only one left.

32
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,500
I'm stating this upfront.

33
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,260
I will absolutely not settle.

34
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,140
I only have one demand.

35
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,250
She must be severely punished.

36
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Cheng Jia must pay for what she did.

37
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:17,960
Ms. Liang,

38
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:20,170
I completely understand how you feel.

39
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,640
But our prosecutor's office

40
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,920
only makes sentencing recommendations.

41
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,000
The final verdict

42
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:26,400
is still subject to the court's judgment.

43
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,400
But won't the court still

44
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:29,860
refer to your sentencing recommendations?

45
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,340
Prosecutor Xu,

46
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,400
I did my research before coming here.

47
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:35,330
My mom had underlying conditions,

48
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:37,330
but Cheng Jia shows no remorse.

49
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,800
She refuses to plead guilty.

50
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,400
It's intentional homicide.

51
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,340
My mom died a tragic death.

52
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,320
I must get justice for her.

53
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:45,200
Also,

54
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,720
I'll persuade Cheng Jia

55
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:48,120
to plead guilty and accept her

56
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:48,850
punishment.

57
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:49,800
That way,

58
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:51,800
the child can see her sooner, right?

59
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,210
And I want to ask,

60
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:55,640
in her case,

61
00:01:56,039 --> 00:01:57,570
how many years will she get?

62
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:59,800
You are willing to actively compensate.

63
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:00,680
Obtaining forgiveness

64
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,200
can reduce the sentence.

65
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:04,800
But I can't give you a specific sentence

66
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:05,640
right now.

67
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,840
Besides, we also need to consider
the victim's family's opinions.

68
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,639
My mom is gone,

69
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:12,200
and the company will collapse with her.

70
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:14,040
That was my mom's life's work.

71
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,040
Prosecutor,

72
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,800
I'm not trying to make
things difficult for you.

73
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,120
My stance is very firm.

74
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,730
I will absolutely not compromise.

75
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:23,960
Zhong,

76
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:24,690
let's go.

77
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,840
Cheng Jia's husband is willing
to pay compensation.

78
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,720
Cui Xiangqin's daughter
refuses to accept it.

79
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:33,680
One wants to pay,

80
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:34,920
the other refuses.

81
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:35,780
What a dilemma.

82
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:38,140
Why does this case look simple

83
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:40,160
but feel so tricky to handle?

84
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,280
I just feel like something is missing.

85
00:02:44,079 --> 00:02:44,640
Ms. Xu,

86
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:47,280
based on our previous tests,

87
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,440
I think Cheng Jia

88
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,400
wasn't pouring medicine,

89
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,960
but wiping the cup.

90
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,329
I agree with you.

91
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,920
But the physical evidence is clear now.

92
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:58,520
We need further verification
with the police.

93
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,480
Let's be frank.

94
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:02,640
I've read

95
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,240
your wife's file.

96
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,160
There are witnesses

97
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:05,880
and physical evidence.

98
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:06,540
It's almost

99
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:07,640
impossible to overturn the case.

100
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:09,520
What was Cheng Jia thinking?

101
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,040
They were so close.

102
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:12,640
How could she do such a thing?

103
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,960
How many years will she get in the end?

104
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:18,079
Life imprisonment or the death penalty
are both possible.

105
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:19,000
Is there any way

106
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,660
to get her a lighter sentence?

107
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,920
I can pay any amount of money.

108
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:23,120
It's not about money.

109
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,360
What matters most

110
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:25,810
is her attitude.

111
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,240
She refuses to plead guilty right now.

112
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,040
This attitude

113
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:29,300
is very bad.

114
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:30,120
Mr. Wei,

115
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,860
please help us out.

116
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,120
You have to go see Cheng Jia again

117
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,120
and persuade her.

118
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,880
Our child is still so young.

119
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:38,160
The kid can't live
without a mother, right?

120
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:38,560
Huang,

121
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,280
the environment of this hotel

122
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,540
is really impeccable.

123
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,720
Especially the room last night.

124
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:45,120
The mattress was so soft.

125
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:47,160
It was so comfortable to sleep on.

126
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:48,490
Eye-opening, isn't it?

127
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,200
This place

128
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,240
belongs to me.

129
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,280
Come anytime you want in the future.

130
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,480
Just mention my name.

131
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,280
From now on,

132
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,610
I'll follow you, Huang.

133
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,460
Have I ever treated you badly?

134
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:01,480
Stick with me,

135
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,250
and you'll live a good life.

136
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,160
Got it.

137
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:06,880
Huang,

138
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:08,820
there's something

139
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:09,960
I want to tell you.

140
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,170
It's about the withdrawal.

141
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,680
I scraped together

142
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,560
25,000.

143
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,519
My balance is

144
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,450
300,000, right?

145
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,399
Ten percent

146
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,320
is 30,000.

147
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:21,920
I'm still

148
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:23,760
5,000 short.

149
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,760
Can you

150
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:26,820
give me a discount?

151
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:27,800
Or

152
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,050
lend me some.

153
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,180
Zhang Qing,

154
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,000
you're not treating me like a friend.

155
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:34,960
What are you talking about,

156
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:35,600
Huang?

157
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:38,120
You've been staying here
these past two days,

158
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,640
getting wined and dined.

159
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,490
I paid for it all.

160
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,860
You had a good time, right?

161
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,560
Did I ever charge you?

162
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:47,920
No, you didn't.

163
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,360
No,

164
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,680
Huang, that's not what I meant.

165
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,240
You know,

166
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:50,920
I

167
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:53,920
just think the processing fee
is a bit high.

168
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,650
I'm just in a rush for the money.

169
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:58,120
You just don't trust me.

170
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,760
There you go again.

171
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,160
How could I not trust you?

172
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:01,560
Huang,

173
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:03,340
just wait a little longer.

174
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,360
There will be a surprise.

175
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:13,840
Our business is booming right now.

176
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:16,370
So many people are eyeing it with envy,

177
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:17,280
got it?

178
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,140
I get it.

179
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,160
You can drop me off here.

180
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,160
I'll go up myself.

181
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:28,490
Qiqi,

182
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,840
are you really not moving back home?

183
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:31,320
No.

184
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,520
My mom is gone.

185
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,490
Don't overthink it.

186
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,520
We're family, after all.

187
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:38,580
From now on,

188
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,720
just treat me as your closest family.

189
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,320
Tell me if you need anything.

190
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:44,810
Okay.

191
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,490
Let's head back.

192
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,200
I've asked around, Huang.

193
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,060
Our Mingjinbao

194
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,520
is a branch

195
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:00,880
of the International Energy Exchange.

196
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:01,560
A major institution,

197
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:01,960
Huang,

198
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:02,360
right?

199
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:08,360
Huang,

200
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:10,760
Huang!

201
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:12,960
You keep staring at her.

202
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:13,820
Do you know her?

203
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:15,760
An acquaintance.

204
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,440
She looks rich.

205
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:20,240
All right,

206
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:22,280
go back if there's nothing else.

207
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:24,080
Call me if you have any problems.

208
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:24,720
Don't keep running over here.

209
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,050
Okay.

210
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:28,970
I'm leaving, Huang.

211
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:30,850
Wait,

212
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:32,680
there's one thing.

213
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,520
You always say you know a lot of people.

214
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,600
One of my shareholders

215
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,520
lost a flash drive.

216
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,380
Help me find it.

217
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,220
What drive?

218
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,200
A flash drive.

219
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,840
The one you plug into a computer.

220
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,880
Search online to see what it looks like.

221
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,400
Keep an eye out for me.

222
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,240
Got it, Huang.

223
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,640
Then I'll ask around.

224
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,120
Understood.

225
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,050
I know the rules.

226
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,920
I'll go find it right now.

227
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:57,760
See you.

228
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:06,760
Keep an eye on that girl

229
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:07,440
for me.

230
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:09,440
Who is she?

231
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,120
Don't ask.

232
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,240
Just watch her closely

233
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,440
and see what she does.

234
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:17,850
Just a reminder.

235
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,770
Change your backup phones too.

236
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:22,360
Use this number

237
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,560
to contact me for now.

238
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,580
These are critical times.

239
00:07:27,200 --> 00:07:27,800
Be careful

240
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:29,080
and cautious.

241
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:31,370
Boss.

242
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:34,640
We've been busting our asses
for half a month,

243
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:36,240
and someone ran off with the money.

244
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:36,760
What do you say...

245
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:38,620
That's why I told you to watch her.

246
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,720
I know what I'm doing.

247
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,320
Keep your guys in line

248
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,740
and don't mess this up.

249
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:52,800
Hello, Zhong.

250
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:56,730
My mom said you were going
to send me a flash drive.

251
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,050
I didn't receive it.

252
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,200
There's a clear trend

253
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:02,880
in the correlation between
her breathing rate and the questions.

254
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:03,940
She's too guarded.

255
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:05,400
Indeed.

256
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:07,840
If she's really innocent

257
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:08,770
like she claims,

258
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:10,610
she should be more cooperative

259
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:14,280
and use the polygraph to increase
the credibility of her statement,

260
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:16,010
instead of ending up like this.

261
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,200
The evidence in this case

262
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:19,060
is quite clear,

263
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,600
but I think Cheng Jia

264
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:21,880
is acting very strange.

265
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:23,080
Let's go see her.

266
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,480
Okay.

267
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,520
Cheng Jia,

268
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,880
I want to double-check something.

269
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:28,600
The day you reconciled with Cui Xiangqin,

270
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,320
before you gave her the aspirin,

271
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,179
was there anything else unusual?

272
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:34,880
I felt like everything was unusual.

273
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,799
I've told you everything I know.

274
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:40,000
I really can't remember anything else.

275
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:41,240
Don't rush to answer.

276
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:42,760
Reviewing evidence

277
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,400
requires constant repetition.

278
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,600
We can't miss a single detail. 388,886.

279
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,570
Think carefully

280
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:51,400
about Cui Xiangqin's expressions
and actions at that time,

281
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:52,660
and recount them to us.

282
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:54,480
This is crucial

283
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,820
for the classification of your case.

284
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:06,740
Did you catch a cold again?

285
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:10,180
You need to take
some anti-inflammatory medicine.

286
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,640
Aspirin.

287
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:14,880
Have some.

288
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,500
Chairman Cui can't take aspirin.

289
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:19,840
Didn't you know that?

290
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,900
It's not her fault.

291
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:23,280
She's entirely devoted to her work,

292
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:24,940
so she forgets a lot of things.

